<p>By bringing the forces of entropy to bear on a target, you prophesize their inevitable doom. Each point in this talent unlocks additional prophecies. A target can only be affected by a single prophecy at a time.</p><ul><li>Level 1: Prophecy of Ruin. Deals <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">71, 96, 115, 131, 145</acronym> damage on falling below 75%, 50% or 25% of maximum life.</li><li>Level 3: Prophecy of Treason. <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">10%, 15%, 18%, 22%, 25%</acronym> chance each turn to attack an ally or themselves.</li><li>Level 5: Prophecy of Madness. Increases talent cooldowns by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">15%, 23%, 29%, 35%, 40%.</acronym></li></ul>